<!doctype html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>REAL.PC V2 — )PC( Upgrade FINAL — PC=Kaiser=Drache — atom.PC → REAL.PC — 9=EVIG 99=EDIT TOR 999=NUTZ BENCH — Rang )9( BORG 7482</title>
<style>
:root{--gold:#ffd700;--gold2:#f0d080;--bg:#050507;--panel:#0a0a0a;--bd:#1a1a1a;--grn:#39ff88;--cyan:#00ccff;--pink:#ff2d9a;--vio:#a855f7;--orange:#ff7a18;--red:#ff4a2e;--dim:#3a4a5a}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--gold);font:11px/1.5 JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace;min-height:100vh}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:99;background:#111;border-bottom:3px solid #000;padding:6px 8px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}
b{color:var(--gold)} .dim{color:#666} .grn{color:var(--grn)} .cyan{color:var(--cyan)} .pink{color:var(--pink)} .vio{color:var(--vio)}
.btn{border:2px solid #000;background:#000;color:#fff;padding:5px 10px;font:900 11px monospace;cursor:pointer}
.btn.gold{background:var(--gold);color:#000}.btn.grn{background:var(--grn);color:#000}.btn.cyan{background:var(--cyan);color:#000}.btn.pink{background:var(--pink);color:#000}.btn.vio{background:var(--vio);color:#fff}
canvas{display:block;width:100%;background:#000;border:2px solid #000}
#gpuCanvas{height:440px}
.status{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;padding:6px;background:#0a0a0a;border-bottom:2px solid #000;font-size:10px}
.status .it{padding:2px 6px;background:#000;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#666}
.status .it b{color:var(--gold)}
.boot{padding:8px;background:#000;border-bottom:3px solid #000;max-height:200px;overflow:auto;font-size:11px;color:var(--grn)}
.boot .l{opacity:0;animation:fade .3s forwards}.ok{color:var(--grn)}.warn{color:var(--gold2)}.err{color:var(--red)}
@keyframes fade{to{opacity:1}}
main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(400px,1.4fr) minmax(320px,1fr);gap:8px;padding:8px}
@media(max-width:950px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.panel{border:3px solid var(--bd);background:var(--panel);padding:8px;border-radius:6px}
.panel h3{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;text-transform:uppercase}
.panel h3 .id{color:var(--gold);font-size:13px;margin-right:6px}
.led{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#222;display:inline-block;transition:.3s}
.led.on{background:var(--grn);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--grn)}
.led.kaiser{background:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--gold);animation:pulse 1s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:.5}50%{opacity:1}}
.regs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:4px;font-size:10px}
.reg{padding:4px 6px;background:#000;border:1px solid #1a1a1a}
.reg .n{color:var(--dim);font-size:8px}.reg .v{color:var(--gold);font-weight:900}
.ram-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(16,1fr);gap:0;font-size:9px}
.ram-grid .c{padding:2px 1px;text-align:center;color:#333;border:1px solid #080808}
.ram-grid .c.has{color:var(--gold);background:#0f0f0a}
.ram-grid .c.pc{background:#2a1a00;color:var(--gold);font-weight:900}
.row{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;margin:3px 0;font-size:10px}
.row .lbl{color:var(--dim);min-width:70px}.row .val{color:var(--gold);font-weight:900}
.term{background:#000;color:var(--grn);font:11px Consolas,monospace;padding:8px;height:260px;overflow:auto;border:2px solid #000;white-space:pre-wrap}
.term-in{display:flex;background:#000;border:2px solid #000;border-top:none}
.term-in span{padding:6px 0 6px 8px;color:var(--gold)}
.term-in input{flex:1;background:transparent;border:none;color:var(--grn);font:11px Consolas,monospace;padding:6px 8px;outline:none}
.kaiserbar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:4px;margin:6px 0}
.kaiserbar .k{padding:6px;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;background:#000;text-align:center;font-size:9px;cursor:pointer}
.kaiserbar .k.active{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold);background:#1a1400}
.drachehud{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin:6px 0}
.drachehud .d{padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;background:#000;font-size:9px;cursor:pointer}
.drachehud .d.active{border-color:var(--cyan);color:var(--cyan)}
.bar{height:6px;background:#000;border:1px solid #222;position:relative;flex:1}
.bar .fill{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;transition:.3s}
.linkrow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;padding:8px;border-top:2px solid #000}
.linkrow a{border:2px solid var(--bd);background:#000;padding:3px 7px;font-size:9px;color:var(--dim)}
.linkrow a:hover{color:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold)}
.eye{border-bottom:3px solid var(--gold);padding:10px;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(#222200,#000);margin-bottom:8px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<b>REAL.PC V2</b><span class="dim">11 22 33 44 55 66 77 88 99 — 9 Repos=1 PC — Rang )9( BORG 7482 — 1MB=1024 — ls -a — BUND — 9076905</span>
<b style="color:#ffd700">55=KAISER=DRACHE zugleich — FINAL</b>
<button class="btn gold" id="btnRun">● RUN</button>
