<span class="dim" style="font-size:9px">eye=rauch auge=licht indy=sensorik — 27er Karussell — 3× ewig 3 — use.js d lassen — alle anderen im Ordner — pipeline.yml Bedarf+Zeit+Bench KO 21%/42%</span>
