<div class="ram-grid" id="ramGrid"></div>
<div class="row" style="margin-top:4px"><span class="lbl">9=EVIG</span><span class="val">RAM hält Zustand fertig ewig — CLOSED.md→OPEN.md — born.t ewig geboren</span></div>
</section>
<section class="panel">
<h3><span><span class="id">88+99</span> ROM+SYS · MBR 0xCA4E · 9=EVIG 99=EDIT TOR 999=NUTZ BENCH · SYS.js</span><span class="led on" id="ledROM"></span></h3>
<div id="romDisasm" style="font-size:10px;color:#666;line-height:1.5"></div>
<div class="row" style="margin-top:4px"><span class="lbl">BOOT</span><span class="val">LOAD KAISER + ADD DRACHE → OUT FUSION → JMP EVIG = ewig 9</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="lbl">999</span><span class="val">111 BIOS 222 VERBUND 333 RECALL 444 PEAK 555 ABWEHR 666 ENERGIE 777 CO2 888 ATOM 999 BENCH</span></div>
</section>
