<h3><span><span class="id">33+22</span> SCSI+ZAHNRAD · sli.ready raid.ready · 33 TURBO 3e · 22 Kuckuck Lauf</span><span class="led on" id="ledSCSI"></span></h3>
<div id="diskLog" style="font-size:10px;color:#666;max-height:90px;overflow:auto"></div>
<div class="row"><span class="lbl">PIPELINE</span><span class="val grn">Multi→Aufstieg→Abstieg→Norm→NC→ANKER — pipeline.yml Bedarf+Zeit+Bench</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="lbl">BUND</span><span class="val">ls -a · 9076905 · .github/workflows/pipeline.yml static.yml · eye=rauch auge=licht indy=sensorik 27er Karussell 3× ewig 3</span></div>
</section>
<section class="panel" style="border-color:#f0d080">
